<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25209" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διᾰμαρτ-ία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>total mistake,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ Ἀννίβου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Fab.</u>
					6
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ τόπου</span> ibid.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τῶν ἡμερῶν</span>
			<i>wrong reckoning</i> of the days, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.89
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τῆς γλώττης,</span>
			<i>lapsus linguae,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Laps.</u>
				1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>gross fault,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγνοιαι καὶ δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.345
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.153b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ἐρωτική</span>”
				<i>guilty passion,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VA</u>
					1.13
				</span></i>
			: pl., <i>faults,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. καὶ . . ἐλαττώσεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Lib.</u>
					p.19O.
				</span></i>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>failure in obtaining, disappointment in,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Sacr.</u>
					1
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				49.28
			</span></i>.</div>
